      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEAST ROYALE (7) stuck on well last time to finish 1.75 lengths back in third (30.92) at this track in a Mix 5 over 520m. Sure to be about the mark. BRUNSWICK FLYER (1) failed to come into contention last start after losing his position early at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (30.53) beating Wiggle On in a Mix 5 on July 16. Cannot be taken lightly. KINGSBRAE BRETT (4) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including two wins and two placings. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (34.57) in a Grade 5/6 last time at this track. Suited here and expected to run well. NANGAR POLLY (3) is building a nice sequence of placings and will be thereabouts again.",
